fer  clients to you you'll have so much more  success long term and you'll feel better  about yourself and what you're doing  do you like ripping off your clients  you'll feel so much better have a lot  more fun with your company when you see  that people love  what it is that you're offering and feel  like they're getting great value  so do it today look at everything you're  selling look at every upsell cross-sell  every product and service you're putting  out there  and really examine it honestly  truthfully  is what you're providing extremely  valuable to your customers do they walk  away  loving the experience and the service  and the value that they're getting from  you and if not then i challenge you  to make your business better make your  offering better and wow your customers  with every experience they have with  your company  that's the path to long-term success as  a business owner  and a lot more happiness too  believe  for those of you watching you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it makes want to do more for you and i'd  love to hear what you have to think  hopefully you're not ripping off your  clients let me know in the comments  below if you have a question put the  comments below too i'll answer it do a  video response thank you guys i'll see  you soon

